---
/**
 * /research — markdown body from content/research.md, then a hardcoded
 * "Analysis of pre- and post-intervention data" callout with three SVG
 * stat cards, the Evaluation Resources block, and the publications list.
 * Mirrors app/pages/research/index.vue.
 */
import { getEntry, render } from "astro:content";
import MarkdownPage from "../layouts/MarkdownPage.astro";
import researchHero from "../assets/research-hero.jpg";

const page = await getEntry("pages", "research");
if (!page) throw new Error("research.md not found");
const { Content } = await render(page);
---

<MarkdownPage
  title={page.data.title}
  description={page.data.summary ??
    "Research, publications, and outcomes of the Safe From the Start program."}
  hero={researchHero}
  heroAlt="Research and data analysis - representing evidence-based practices in the Safe From the Start program"
  publishedAt={page.data.publishedAt}
>
  <Content />

  <div class="mt-10">
    <p>
      Analysis of pre- and post-intervention data has shown <sup
        ><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1">1</a></sup
      >:
    </p>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-2 my-4"
    >
      <div
        class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg p-10 text-center shadow"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="120"
          height="120"
          class="mx-auto mb-6 text-green-700"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            fill="currentColor"
            d="M14 4a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0M9 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0v3.66l1.92.4a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.13l-1.18 7.7a1 1 0 0 1-1 .86h-5.04a1 1 0 0 1-1-.86l-1.18-7.7a1 1 0 0 1 .78-1.13L9 13.16zM6 18a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0m-3.5 2h7l-.18 1.18a1 1 0 0 1-1 .82h-4.64a1 1 0 0 1-1-.82z"
          />
        </svg>
        A significant reduction in the number of children that scored in the
        borderline or clinical ranges for social, emotional, and behavioral
        concerns after receiving services.
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg p-10 text-center shadow"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="120"
          height="120"
          class="mx-auto mb-6 text-green-700"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            fill="currentColor"
            d="M9 11.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0-2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0 2.5m6 0a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0-2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0 2.5M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20M8 14h8a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"
          />
        </svg>
        Caregivers had reduced stress.
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg p-10 text-center shadow"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="120"
          height="120"
          class="mx-auto mb-6 text-green-700"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            fill="currentColor"
            d="M12 2a8 8 0 0 0-8 8c0 2.5 1.15 4.74 2.96 6.21L7 22l2.5-2 1.5 1.5 1.5-1.5L15 22l.04-5.79A8 8 0 0 0 20 10a8 8 0 0 0-8-8m0 2a6 6 0 1 1 0 12 6 6 0 0 1 0-12"
          />
        </svg>
        Children's ability to identify feelings and caregiver's knowledge of
        trauma and its impact improved.
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="sfs-evaluation-resources" class="mt-8">SFS Evaluation Resources</h2>
    <p><em>Forms</em></p>
    <ul>
      <li><p>Intake Form - Forthcoming</p></li>
      <li><p>Exit Form - Forthcoming</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p><em>Evaluation Protocol</em></p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a href="/SFS_Evaluation_Protocol_FINAL_10012024.docx" target="_blank"
            >Evaluation Protocol<span class="sr-only">
              (DOCX, opens in new window)</span
            ></a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li><p>Frequently Asked Questions - Forthcoming</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p><em>Training Materials</em></p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/QuickStart_PartOne_NavIntakeBIF.pdf" target="_blank"
          >SFS Database 1.0 User's Quick Start Guide PT 1<span class="sr-only">
            (PDF, opens in new window)</span
          ></a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="sfs-and-related-research-publications">
      SFS and Related Research Publications
    </h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/researchhub/articles/addressing-child-exposure-to-violence"
            >Addressing Child Exposure to Violence</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/researchhub/articles/state-fiscal-year-2020-safe-from-the-start-annual-report-2001-2020/"
            >State Fiscal Year 2020 Safe From the Start Annual Report: 2001-2020</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/about/publications/safe-from-the-start-year-13-2001-2014/"
            >Safe From the Start Year 13: 2001-2014</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/about/publications/safe-from-the-start-year-12-report-2001-2013/"
            >Safe From the Start Year 12 Report: 2001-2013</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/about/publications/2022-victim-service-planning-research-report/"
            >2022 Victim Service Planning Research Report</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://icjia.illinois.gov/researchhub/articles/2022-safe-from-the-start-process-evaluation/"
            >2022 Safe From the Start Process Evaluation</a
          >
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="references">References</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;" id="fn-1">
      <sup>1</sup> Gonzalez, L. F., Nguyen, S. L., &amp; Kirkner, A. (2022).
      <i>State fiscal year 2020 Safe From the Start annual report: 2001-2020</i>.
      Illinois Criminal Justice Information Authority.
    </p>
  </div>
</MarkdownPage>
